<km>

***  

A toolkit for interacting with MongoDB Audit data in Gravwell. This kit includes queries, resources (lookups), templates, autoextractors, macros, dashboards, alerts, scheduled searches, and flows to help streamline MongoDB Audit analysis across Audit log sources.  

***  

