    - AlertQuery - MongoDB - Database - Audit - Alerts - User Created [table]: Detects MongoDB database user creation.  
    - AlertQuery - MongoDB - Database - Audit - Alerts - User Dropped [table]: Detects MongoDB database user deletion.  
    - AlertQuery - MongoDB - Database - Audit - Alerts - User Updated [table]: Detects MongoDB database user updates including password and role changes.  
- Naming Schema: *AlertQuery - MongoDB - Database - Audit - Overview - Count by Tag [numbercard]*  

***  

## 9. [Templates](#9-templates)  

- Purpose: Templates are special objects which define a Gravwell query containing variables.  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/gui/templates/templates.html>)  
- Total: ***5***  
    - Template - MongoDB - Database - Audit - Investigation - Count by Category [numbercard]: This is intended to show a numbercard of events by category for the User or IP that you are investigating within the time frame that you specify.  
    - Template - MongoDB - Database - Audit - Investigation - Count by Result [numbercard]: This is intended to show a numbercard of events by result when you're investigating a User or IP for possible nefarious actions.  
    - Template - MongoDB - Database - Audit - Investigation - Count by Subcategory [numbercard]: This is intended to show a numbercard of events by subcategory for the User or IP that you are investigating within the time frame that you specify.  
    - Template - MongoDB - Database - Audit - Investigation - Recent Events [table]: This is intended to show a table of the recent events when you're investigating a User or IP for possible nefarious actions.  
    - Template - MongoDB - Database - Audit - Investigation - Total Events [numbercard]: This is intended to show a numbercard of total events for the User or IP that you are investigating within the time frame that you specify.  

***  

## 10. [Dashboards](#10-dashboards)  

- Purpose: Dashboards are Gravwell’s way of showing the results from multiple searches at the same time.  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/gui/dashboards/dashboards.html>)  
- Total: ***2***  
    - MongoDB Audit General Overview: This Dashboard is a general overview of your MongoDB Audit logs.  
    - MongoDB Audit Investigation: Investigate MongoDB Audit activity for a User or IP.  

#### 10.1. [Actionables](#10-1-actionables)  

- Purpose: Actionables provide a way to create custom menus that key on any text rendered in a query; users can take different actions on that text by selecting options in the menus.  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/gui/actionables/actionables.html>)  
- Total: ***2***  
    - MongoDB Audit User: MongoDB Audit Actions on Actor to Launch MongoDB Audit Investigation Dashboard.  
    - MongoDB Audit IP: MongoDB Audit Actions on IP to Launch MongoDB Audit Investigation Dashboard.  

***  

